AUDIO: 'partnering with Higgsfield on this video because that connector is what turns the whole workflow from a review checklist into a full production studio. &gt;&gt; [music] &gt;&gt; Without it, Fable 5 can say what the visual should be. With it, Fable actually creates the visual. [music]'

